# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context. If this file is
# absent, gcloud derives one from .gitignore; when present it is used INSTEAD.
#
# NOTE: do not `#!include:.dockerignore` here — that file starts with `*`
# (exclude everything, then re-include src/), which would drop the Dockerfile
# itself from the *upload*. Docker's own build special-cases the Dockerfile;
# the context upload does not. So list the exclusions explicitly and keep the
# Dockerfile + the crate source.

.git
.gitignore
old/
docs/
deploy/
download_data.sh
*.md

# build artifacts, the multi-GB dataset, prior run output — never needed to compile
src/target/
src/data/
src/output/
src/.dist/
src/docs/

**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
